<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1787448337"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:22.319"><div begin="38.017" end="52.421" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="38.017" end="41.096" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.017" end="39.024">蒙住眼睛</span><span begin="39.024" end="40.182">我看不</span><span begin="40.182" end="41.096">到</span></p><p begin="41.801" end="44.862" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.801" end="42.769">堵住耳朵</span><span begin="42.769" end="44.031">我听不</span><span begin="44.031" end="44.862">到</span></p><p begin="45.604" end="48.581" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.604" end="46.614">那是喝彩</span><span begin="46.614" end="47.759">还是尖</span><span begin="47.759" end="48.581">叫</span></p><p begin="49.187" end="52.421" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.187" end="50.339">重要吗</span> <span begin="51.086" end="52.421">不重要</span></p></div><div begin="53.235" end="1:07.720" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="53.235" end="56.281" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.235" end="54.203">往前走三</span><span begin="54.203" end="54.663">步</span><span begin="54.663" end="55.406">该起</span><span begin="55.406" end="56.281">跳</span></p><p begin="56.993" end="1:00.031" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.993" end="57.991">跳过熊熊</span><span begin="57.991" end="59.147">大火燃</span><span begin="59.147" end="1:00.031">烧</span></p><p begin="1:00.805" end="1:03.879" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.805" end="1:01.800">不是我天</span><span begin="1:01.800" end="1:03.056">生就知</span><span begin="1:03.056" end="1:03.879">道</span></p><p begin="1:04.113" end="1:07.720" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.113" end="1:05.484">是他们</span><span begin="1:05.940" end="1:06.754">教得</span><span begin="1:06.754" end="1:07.720">好</span></p></div><div begin="1:10.292" end="1:41.873" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:10.292" end="1:15.450" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.292" end="1:13.970">斩下我身上的凤毛</span><span begin="1:13.970" end="1:15.450">麟角</span></p><p begin="1:17.825" end="1:23.267" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.825" end="1:21.560">炼成广告里的灵丹</span><span begin="1:21.560" end="1:23.267">妙药</span></p><p begin="1:25.462" end="1:30.940" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.462" end="1:29.103">感谢我付出的辛苦</span><span begin="1:29.103" end="1:30.940">勤劳</span></p><p begin="1:32.080" end="1:41.873" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.080" end="1:32.901">然后</span><span begin="1:33.108" end="1:34.076">把</span><span begin="1:34.076" end="1:34.594">我</span><span begin="1:34.594" end="1:39.012">打回黑漆漆</span><span begin="1:39.687" end="1:40.170">的</span><span begin="1:40.170" end="1:41.873">牢</span></p></div><div begin="1:57.810" end="2:12.144" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:57.810" end="2:00.716" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:57.810" end="1:59.187">我擦干了泪</span><span begin="1:59.187" end="1:59.895">不计</span><span begin="1:59.895" end="2:00.716">较</span></p><p begin="2:01.561" end="2:04.545" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:01.561" end="2:02.491">苦心孤诣</span><span begin="2:02.491" end="2:03.705">是为我</span><span begin="2:03.705" end="2:04.545">好</span></p><p begin="2:05.324" end="2:08.324" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:05.324" end="2:06.285">一个巴掌</span><span begin="2:06.285" end="2:06.784">换</span><span begin="2:06.784" end="2:07.494">一个</span><span begin="2:07.494" end="2:08.324">枣</span></p><p begin="2:08.673" end="2:12.144" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:08.673" end="2:09.440">这便</span><span begin="2:09.440" end="2:10.153">宜</span> <span begin="2:10.518" end="2:11.293">谁不</span><span begin="2:11.293" end="2:12.144">要</span></p></div><div begin="2:12.971" end="2:27.737" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:12.971" end="2:15.928" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:12.971" end="2:13.911">一巴掌不</span><span begin="2:13.911" end="2:14.378">准</span><span begin="2:14.378" end="2:14.634">我</span><span begin="2:14.634" end="2:15.928">撕咬</span></p><p begin="2:16.081" end="2:19.789" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:16.081" end="2:16.559">又</span><span begin="2:16.559" end="2:17.689">一巴掌别妄</span><span begin="2:17.689" end="2:18.943">想能逃</span><span begin="2:18.943" end="2:19.789">跑</span></p><p begin="2:20.573" end="2:23.542" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:20.573" end="2:21.509">我不是待</span><span begin="2:21.509" end="2:22.714">宰的羊</span><span begin="2:22.714" end="2:23.542">羔</span></p><p begin="2:23.855" end="2:27.737" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:23.855" end="2:24.577">有尖</span><span begin="2:24.577" end="2:25.495">牙</span> <span begin="2:25.758" end="2:26.523">有利</span><span begin="2:26.523" end="2:27.737">爪</span></p></div><div begin="2:28.097" end="2:59.626" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="2:28.097" end="2:33.255" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:28.097" end="2:31.775">斩下我身上的凤毛</span><span begin="2:31.775" end="2:33.255">麟角</span></p><p begin="2:35.742" end="2:41.184" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:35.742" end="2:39.477">炼成广告里的灵丹</span><span begin="2:39.477" end="2:41.184">妙药</span></p><p begin="2:43.337" end="2:48.403" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:43.337" end="2:46.566">不想再继续沉默</span><span begin="2:46.566" end="2:47.456">多一</span><span begin="2:47.456" end="2:48.403">秒</span></p><p begin="2:49.934" end="2:59.626" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:49.934" end="2:50.732">可我</span><span begin="2:50.969" end="2:51.851">已</span><span begin="2:51.851" end="2:56.798">经忘了该怎么</span><span begin="2:57.521" end="2:58.052">咆</span><span begin="2:58.052" end="2:59.626">哮</span></p></div><div begin="2:58.202" end="3:28.439" itunes:songPart="Bridge"><p begin="2:58.202" end="3:04.684" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:58.202" end="2:59.941">是孤鹜桀</span><span begin="2:59.941" end="3:00.972">骜</span> <span begin="3:01.977" end="3:03.731">是跪地求</span><span begin="3:03.731" end="3:04.684">饶</span></p><p begin="3:05.706" end="3:12.646" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:05.706" end="3:07.802">要精致的饲</span><span begin="3:07.802" end="3:08.721">料</span> <span begin="3:09.428" end="3:11.541">或定制的链</span><span begin="3:11.541" end="3:12.646">条</span></p><p begin="3:13.233" end="3:19.713" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:13.233" end="3:15.634">我肉痛皮笑</span> <span begin="3:17.009" end="3:18.730">我睚眦必</span><span begin="3:18.730" end="3:19.713">报</span></p><p begin="3:20.831" end="3:28.439" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:20.831" end="3:23.976">要暗无天日的城</span><span begin="3:23.976" end="3:24.589">堡</span> <span begin="3:24.883" end="3:26.767">用银和金装</span><span begin="3:26.767" end="3:28.439">裱</span></p></div><div begin="3:28.793" end="4:00.376" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="3:28.793" end="3:33.951" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:28.793" end="3:32.508">斩下我身上的凤毛</span><span begin="3:32.508" end="3:33.951">麟角</span></p><p begin="3:36.467" end="3:41.899" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:36.467" end="3:40.093">只要死不了能重新</span><span begin="3:40.093" end="3:40.719">长</span><span begin="3:40.719" end="3:41.899">好</span></p><p begin="3:44.002" end="3:49.174" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:44.002" end="3:47.404">钻进反覆几百次</span><span begin="3:47.404" end="3:48.164">的圈</span><span begin="3:48.164" end="3:49.174">套</span></p><p begin="3:50.729" end="4:00.376" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:50.729" end="3:51.539">我会</span><span begin="3:51.659" end="3:52.637">配</span><span begin="3:52.637" end="3:52.996">得</span><span begin="3:52.996" end="3:57.526">上你廉价的</span><span begin="3:58.375" end="3:59.083">门</span><span begin="3:59.083" end="4:00.376">票</span></p></div></body></tt>